1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,811
Caesar salad

2
00:00:00,837 --> 00:00:01,651
isn't from Italy.

3
00:00:01,669 --> 00:00:02,444
Not even close.

4
00:00:02,462 --> 00:00:03,349
Not Julius.

5
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,093
Not Rome.

6
00:00:04,107 --> 00:00:05,166
Not even Italy.

7
00:00:05,176 --> 00:00:07,016
It was invented in Tijuana, Mexico,

8
00:00:07,042 --> 00:00:08,065
